<title>UK: HORSE RACING-QUEEN MOTHER CHAMPION CHASE RESULT.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-QUEEN MOTHER CHAMPION CHASE RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>CHELTENHAM, England 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the</p>
<p>feature race on the second day of the three-day Cheltenham</p>
<p>Festival on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Queen Mother Champion Chase, for five-year-olds and upwards,</p>
<p>run over two miles (3.2 km):</p>
<p> 1. Martha's Son    9-1 (ridden by Rodney Farrant)</p>
<p> 2. Ask Tom	   6-1 (R.Garritty)</p>
<p> 3. Viking Flagship 3-1 (Richard Dunwoody)</p>
<p>Six ran.</p>
<p>Distances: Two and a half lengths, half a length.</p>
<p>Value to winner: 81,600 pounds ($129,000).</p>
